-(``kanban_admission.hub_cpu_advisory``); a sample older than 15 s defers the claim as ``hub_cpu_unknown``. On
+(``kanban_admission.hub_cpu_advisory``); a sample older than 10 s (``PRELEASE_MAX_AGE_MS``) defers the claim as
